                    "text": "<p>AltaRasa may use your information for purposes including:</p><ul><li>Operating and enhancing the Website and Services</li><li>Delivering products, services, and features you request</li><li>Managing registrations, subscriptions, or transactions</li><li>Understanding user preferences to improve offerings</li><li>Conducting analytics and usage tracking</li><li>Providing customer support</li><li>Sending updates, offers, promotions, and marketing communications</li><li>Delivering reminders, alerts, administrative notices, and security messages</li><li>Displaying advertisements via email or other channels</li><li>Managing internal business operations such as compliance, fraud prevention, and </li></ul>",
