            "accordion_row_6Ui7hM": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Non-Returnable & Non-Exchangeable Products",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "keywords": "",
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_LjxCTK": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>For hygiene, customization, and policy reasons, the following items cannot be returned or exchanged:</p><ul><li>All accessories: jewellery, clutches, wallets, bags, scarves, belts, footwear, etc.</li><li>Custom-made or made-to-order products</li><li>Orders purchased using store credit</li><li>Unstitched pieces such as dupattas or sarees with unstitched blouse fabric</li><li>Items altered to your personal measurements</li><li>Products bought during sales, promotions, or special offers</li><li>Products marked as “non-returnable/non-exchangeable” at the time of purchase</li></ul>",
