              "blocks": {
                "text_UUMmBi": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<ul><li>AltaRasa Gift Cards are valid for a period of 6 months once issued.</li><li>An account on the AltaRasa website is required to redeem a Gift Card.</li><li>Gift Cards can be used across all eligible AltaRasa platforms.</li><li>Gift Cards cannot be refunded, exchanged for cash, transferred, or used to buy another Gift Card.</li><li>If your order exceeds the Gift Card value, the balance must be paid at checkout (COD not permitted).</li><li>If you return an item purchased via Gift Card, the refund will follow AltaRasa’s return policy and be reissued as store credit.</li><li>AltaRasa is not responsible for lost, stolen, or unauthorized Gift Card use.</li><li>AltaRasa may cancel or reject a Gift Card if misuse or invalidity is suspected.</li></ul>",
